        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the decaying halls of Mortimer Manor, where every ticking second erodes your grip on reality. In <strong>Doomed Inheritance</strong>, you’ll navigate grand foyers, shadowed galleries, and winding catacombs—all while a relentless sanity meter displayed as a brain icon fractures under the strain.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sanity System:</strong> Watch your brain HUD icon crack and splinter as time slips away. When your mind falters, controls stutter and visuals distort, heightening the dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Secrets:</strong> Hunt for hidden alcoves, secret pantries, and forgotten journals that shed light on the Mortimer curse—and grant fleeting relief in the form of youth vials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Presentation:</strong> Immerse yourself in hand‐crafted Gothic corridors, eerie soundscapes, and flickering candlelight that reveal—or conceal—the manor’s darkest secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Content:</strong> Experience the opening chapters, from the grand staircase down to the relic‐filled catacombs. Future updates may expand the estate, introduce fresh puzzles, and deepen the narrative, guided by community feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to inherit centuries of ambition—and pay the ultimate price? Your borrowed time begins now.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the decaying halls of Mortimer Manor, where every ticking second erodes your grip on reality. In <strong>Doomed Inheritance</strong>, you’ll navigate grand foyers, shadowed galleries, and winding catacombs—all while a relentless sanity meter displayed as a brain icon fractures under the strain.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sanity System:</strong> Watch your brain HUD icon crack and splinter as time slips away. When your mind falters, controls stutter and visuals distort, heightening the dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Secrets:</strong> Hunt for hidden alcoves, secret pantries, and forgotten journals that shed light on the Mortimer curse—and grant fleeting relief in the form of youth vials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Presentation:</strong> Immerse yourself in hand‐crafted Gothic corridors, eerie soundscapes, and flickering candlelight that reveal—or conceal—the manor’s darkest secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Content:</strong> Experience the opening chapters, from the grand staircase down to the relic‐filled catacombs. Future updates may expand the estate, introduce fresh puzzles, and deepen the narrative, guided by community feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to inherit centuries of ambition—and pay the ultimate price? Your borrowed time begins now.</p>",
